    "en": "Physician Data Query (PDQ) Terminology is part of NCI's comprehensive cancer information database, which contains expert summaries on a wide range of cancer topics, a listing of some 30,000 cancer clinical trials from around the world, a directory of genetics services professionals, the NCI Dictionary of Cancer Terms, and the NCI Drug Dictionary."
